# Local agent/skill tooling — not project code. .claude/settings.json and the
# committed CLAUDE.md stay tracked; installed skills, spawned agents and
# worktrees are machine-local and run to tens of megabytes.
.agents/
.trae/
.superpowers/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/skills/
.claude/agents/

# CJK variable-font SOURCES: inputs to scripts/build-cfp-fonts.mjs only, never
# loaded at runtime (react-pdf cannot use variable fonts — see pdf/cfpReport/
# fonts.ts). 43MB that would sit in history forever. Download from
# https://fonts.google.com/noto when the static faces need rebuilding; the baked
# XwSansSC-*/XwSerifSC-* faces ARE committed because the report needs them.
public/fonts/*-VF.ttf
